"artist":"David Sylvian","artist_id":203959564543639,"title":"Approaching Silence","year":1994,"ess":0,"yt":"VuS7CDDjN4A","kind":"s","book":{"id":8,"title":"A History of Rock Music 1951-2000","author":"Piero Scaruffi","url":"https://volteret4.github.io/scaruffi/"},"scene":"Pintores de sonido británicos","scene_id":8157416705849,"scene_link":"https://volteret4.github.io/scaruffi/#sound-painters","chapters":["Sección 5.12"],"pages":[[1,165,null]]},{"id":112527026855442,"artist":"David Sylvian","artist_id":203959564543639,"title":"Manafon","year":2009,"ess":0,"yt":"8BzlYu2MJCs","kind":null,"book":{"id":10,"title":"Loops 1 y 2. Una historia de la música electrónica","author":"Javier Blánquez (ed.)","url":"https://volteret4.github.io/loops_timeline/"},"scene":"Ambient","scene_id":138785454098987,"scene_link":"https://volteret4.github.io/loops_timeline/#ambient","chapters":["Loops 2 · Cap. 8: Repetición y sentido: escultores de ambientes, guerrilleros del ruido, nuevos contemporáneos y otras escenas experimentales"],"pages":[[2,267]]}],"mentions":[{"book":"A History of Rock Music 1951-2000","author":"Piero Scaruffi","page":59,"text":"…manifesto of his \"frippertronics\", two collaborations with Police's guitarist Andy Summers, notably I Advance Masked (1982), a collaboration with David Sylvian, The First Day (1993), were just the tip of the iceberg. Van Der Graaf Generator (12) were in many ways the most original of the early prog-rock…"},{"book":"A History of Rock Music 1951-2000","author":"Piero Scaruffi","page":66,"text":"…marriage of electronics and ethnic music, i.e. the birth of electronic world-music. Czukay would explore this theme two decades later, when pop-star David Sylvian lent a hand to the lengthy suites of Plight And Premonition (1988) and Flux And Mutability (1989), particularly Plight. The cosmic couriers…"},{"book":"A History of Rock Music 1951-2000","author":"Piero Scaruffi","page":165,"text":"…which led to the funky-ethnic electronic muzak of Neo Geo (1987) and Beauty (1990), influenced by Peter Gabriel, Talking Heads and Brian Eno. David Sylvian (3) may have been the most ambitious of the new-wave veterans. A clever and sensitive student of Riuychi Sakamoto, Brian Eno, Robert Fripp, Peter…"},{"book":"Loops 1 y 2. Una historia de la música electrónica","author":"Javier Blánquez (ed.)","page":141,"text":"…como The Garden o The Golden Section, o sus producciones para la poetisa electrónica Anne Clark. Ultravox, de igual manera que los Japan de David Sylvian, pusieron en juego la herencia del glam-rock, la del artificio visual y la pluma, la de la pose afectada y las canciones épicas. Y el glam estuvo en…"},{"book":"Loops 1 y 2. Una historia de la música electrónica","author":"Javier Blánquez (ed.)","page":267,"text":"…artístico: en discos con abundancia de grabaciones de campo como When Loud Weather Buffeted Naoshima (2007) o Manafon (2009), el veterano músico David Sylvian dejó que los propios sonidos de la naturaleza se infiltraran en un tejido de armonías compartidas con el folk, la improvisación libre y el ambient,…"}],"podcast":[],"awards":[],"concerts":[],"xref":[],"charts":[{"id":71656760403274,"type":"album","name":"Brilliant Trees","list_id":210775829953573,"list":"RYM Top — Pop — Art Pop","src":"musthear","rank":96,"year":1984,"note":null,"yt":"bYB-6pfvWNc","scaruffi":7.0},{"id":71656760403274,"type":"album","name":"Brilliant Trees","list_id":52032266791182,"list":"Scaruffi 1980s","src":"musthear","rank":352,"year":1984,"note":null,"yt":"bYB-6pfvWNc","scaruffi":7.0},{"id":141170515340142,"type":"album","name":"Alchemy: An Index of Possibilities","list_id":201123809480309,"list":"RYM Top — Ambient — Tribal Ambient","src":"musthear","rank":35,"year":1985,"note":null,"yt":"TbMIw4_qmNM","scaruffi":null},{"id":275468869749893,"type":"album","name":"Words With The Shaman","list_id":52032266791182,"list":"Scaruffi 1980s","src":"musthear","rank":853,"year":1985,"note":null,"yt":"dmJkzyiAJtk","scaruffi":7.0},{"id